orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":15,"created_at":"2025-03-24T04:05:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T17:08:39Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4 stable\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS v15/windows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nA label control with lots of texts behave differently with custom font. With default font, draw call is 31, with custom font, draw call increased to 237.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3adf8cce-3eb4-427a-96cb-47279c83c3c9)\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cce73089-5aca-49f7-b5f6-fd489dd12ce1)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new project.\n2. Create a new 2d scene.\n3. Add a label and set lots of Chinese text.\n4. Run, in editor -> debugger -> monitor, and pick draw call, notice the total draw call is 31.\n5. Stop\n6. Set label's theme_override -> fonts to load a custom font\n7. Run, notice the total draw call increased to 237\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[2d_batching_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19414145/2d_batching_test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104537/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":5},"timeline_url":"h